---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeroSection from '../components/HeroSection.astro';
import BookingPanel from '../components/BookingPanel.astro';
import PricingPreview from '../components/PricingPreview.astro';
---

<Layout
  visual
  title="Kifaru by Bastco | Your AI red teammate"
  description="Inspect a sample Kifaru finding, see the evidence behind it, and learn how local execution, model access, and proposed licensing work."
>
  <HeroSection productPage />
  <div class="site-container">
    <nav class="product-subnav" aria-label="On this page">
      <a href="#models">Model access</a>
      <a href="#boundaries">Operating limits</a>
      <a href="#pricing">Proposed pricing</a>
      <a href="#demo">Talk to Bastco</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <section id="models" class="section site-container cost-story" aria-labelledby="models-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Model access</p>
      <h2 id="models-heading">Bring your model</h2>
      <p>
        Connect a supported model provider. Kifaru runs tools on your machine,
        but model requests can send assessment context to the provider. Check
        your provider’s data settings before sharing evidence.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="cost-ledger">
      <div>
        <div>
          <h3>Kifaru license</h3>
          <p>The proposed plans cover the workbench. They don’t include model usage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div>
          <h3>Model costs</h3>
          <p>Your provider bills for inference. If you run a local model, you supply the compute.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="small-note">Usage budgets track reported consumption. They don’t cap provider charges.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="boundaries" class="site-container" aria-labelledby="limits-heading">
    <div class="boundary-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Before you run Kifaru</p>
        <h2 id="limits-heading">Local execution is not a sandbox</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          Use Kifaru only for authorized assessments. Tools run with your host’s
          filesystem and network permissions. Choosing a target or working
          directory does not create a technical sandbox.
        </p>
        <details>
          <summary>Operator checklist</summary>
          <ul>
            <li>Agree on scope and use a trusted workspace.</li>
            <li>Review requested actions. Signing in to the dashboard does not isolate execution.</li>
            <li>Check findings independently before reporting them.</li>
          </ul>
        </details>
        <a class="text-link" href="/security">Security &amp; responsible use <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <PricingPreview />
  <section id="demo" class="site-container contact-panel">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Talk to Bastco</p>
      <h2>Will Kifaru fit your team?</h2>
      <p>Tell us how you review findings today. We can discuss model access, deployment, and licensing for your team.</p>
    </div>
    <BookingPanel />
  </section>
</Layout>
